{
  "item": "Balrog01",
  "mu_name": "Balrog",
  "mu_name_from": "MuMain's MONSTER_MODEL_BALROG = 27, so OpenMonsterModel loads Monster28.bmd; the server's type is MONSTER_BALROG = 38. The client's name is 발록 (ZzzCharacter.cpp:13868-13875). OpenMU's Version075 LostTower.cs:788-819 names number 38 'Balrog' at level 66 with 9000 health, 220-240 damage, 160 defense, MoveRange 3, AttackRange 2, ViewRange 7, AttackDelay 1600, MonsterSkill (150) -- WebZen's one-in-five Flame of Evil, not built yet. Two spots, both on Lost Tower 7: the tower's boss.",
  "world": "losttower",
  "object_type": 38,
  "monster": {
    "model_index": 27,
    "scale": 1.6
  },
  "monster_from": "ZzzCharacter.cpp:13868-13875, CreateMonster, case MONSTER_BALROG: `c->Weapon[0].Type = MODEL_BILL_OF_BALROG; c->Weapon[0].Level = 9; c->Object.Scale = 1.6f;`.",
  "right_hand": "Spear10",
  "right_hand_bone": "knife_gdf",
  "plus": {
    "right_hand": 9
  },
  "right_hand_from": "MODEL_BILL_OF_BALROG is Item/Spear10.bmd, cooked, at Level 9. Its bone is CreateCharacter's weapon switch: `case MODEL_BALROG: c->Weapon[0].LinkBone = 17; c->Weapon[1].LinkBone = 28` (ZzzCharacter.cpp:12012-12015) -- 17 is knife_gdf.",
  "profile": "monster",
  "rig_from": "Seven actions, slots 0 to 6, exported with --actions=0,1,2,3,4,5,6. Keys: 12, 12, 6, 6, 6, 6, 7. BoneHead = 6, Bip01 Head (ZzzOpenData.cpp). OpenMonsterModel's default play speeds.",
  "sheets": {
    "ho9_11": "balrog_ho9_11.png",
    "ho9_2": "balrog_ho9_2.png"
  },
  "sheet_from": "Two sheets, no alpha: ho9_11 (256 square) on the body (1398 triangles), ho9_2 (128 by 64, red streaks on black) on mesh 1 (52). Decoded under a balrog_ prefix.",
  "sheet_materials": {
    "ho9_11": "painted_steel",
    "ho9_2": "painted_steel"
  },
  "sheet_materials_from": "Read off ho9_11: crimson plate with black lacquer and gold trim -- horned helm, pauldrons, a segmented tail -- painted armour, painted_steel.",
  "glow": {
    "ho9_2": {
      "scrolls_per_second": 1.0
    }
  },
  "glow_from": "StreamMesh = 1 (ZzzOpenData.cpp, MONSTER_MODEL_BALROG) and MoveCharacterVisual's `o->BlendMeshTexCoordV = -(float)((int)(WorldTime) % 1000) * 0.001f` (ZzzCharacter.cpp:6013-6015): mesh 1 unlit, its V scrolled a sheet a second (ZzzBMD.cpp:1352-1368). MU draws the stream mesh opaque; ours adds it as a glow, so its black is nothing and the red streams run as fire.",
  "effects_from": "Not built: its skill's showing -- MODEL_CIRCLE, CIRCLE_LIGHT and sHellFire (ZzzCharacter.cpp:1974-1985) -- and WebZen's Flame of Evil, which wait for the bosses' area blow. And SetPlayerWalk plays SOUND_BONE2 under each Balrog step besides its cry (:762-763).",
  "sounds_from": "ZzzOpenData.cpp: mBalrog1, mBalrog2, mWizardAttack2, mGorgonAttack2, mBalrogDie, SetMonsterSound(..., 108, 109, 110, 111, 112): moves to mBalrog1/2, swings and flinches to mWizardAttack2/mGorgonAttack2, dies to mBalrogDie. Wired as balrog_*.",
  "islands_from": "All painted_steel: the plate is the whole sheet and the stream mesh is drawn as a glow. They arrived as skin, the monster profile's default.",
